{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is visible then approach and pick it up, check properties and perform specific task, otherwise scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDesiredLocation    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
